  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere ((dance) package), associated skill 8 ranks.</p>\n<p>You gain a +10-feet enhancement bonus to the speed of all of your movement modes (excluding land speed) while maintaining this dance; you must already possess such a movement mode to gain this benefit.</p>\n<p>All dancers gain all alternate movement modes that you possess (burrow, fly, or swim) equal to your base speed with that movement mode—a fly speed granted this way has a maneuverability one step worse than your own. If such a dancer already possesses such an alternate movement mode, the dancer gains a +10-feet enhancement bonus to the movement mode's speed.</p>\n<p>If a creature would move out of your dance area while burrowing, flying, or swimming, they retain its benefits for 1 round after.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
